/*
  TripSummaryWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0103 · TripSummaryWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TripSummaryWidget` resolves (table "TripSummaryWidget") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/TripSummaryWidget.tsx + registry/driving.ts). The
  remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry/empty/
  error copy, connectivity banners, accessibility).
*/

